Z||000007||DaRkLoRD||06-10-2001||05:33 PM||||Cool pics! I'll get Heather to scan the ones she took as soon as she finishes the roll of film and gets it developed.. The video we took wasn't too bad, but I wish I'd had the camera when I went out for the first cruise with Becky... that first turn was amazing.. LOL..<P>Hey Chris, down by the beach on the way out of town, we saw another cop right behind you.. was he after someone else, or was it about your exhaust again?<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||10
