Z||000009||Huck||06-10-2001||08:53 PM||||Wow guys.  Looks like you had a great turnout, and the weather couldn't have been better.  I was thinking of you guys when I was building my dads deck for him.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  You will have to do this again soon so I can experience it too!  I'm sure the great lineup of fiero's turned a lot of heads that day!  After I get my clutch line on though, the weather will probably turn crapy for the rest of the summer... just the way my luck works.<P>Huck<BR>87 GT T-top<P>P.S. - silver notchback with 3 spoke rims and basket handle spoiler.... 2 Thumbs up!!<BR>||||reg||1
